  "scope": "2D package cross-section against presentation tray deck, conservative chute top chord and 0.8cm bin front/back walls. Bin X has >8cm total margin. Not a 3D manufacturing-clearance or dynamic-load certification. Other fixed geometry must remain separately checked.",
  "proposal": "Four stages retain progress splits .35/.65/.82. stage1 lerp old tray center to entry + chute normal*(height/2+.4), pitch 0->20deg, plus Z 1.5*sin(pi*f). stage2 lerp normal-offset entry->outlet, constant pitch. stage3 lerp normal-offset outlet->above-bin, pitch 20->0. stage4 vertical descent, zero pitch. UE roll is -sideSign*20deg; normal UE Y=sideSign*sin(20deg).",
  "continuity": "Centers and orientations match at all three phase boundaries. Use a captured resting stack height during unloading, or prevent collection from changing the target stack mid-descent."
